:["DECLARED_ANNOTATION_COLOR","WITNESS_LABEL_GLYPH"],"styles":[{"color":1865405,"font":"00-GBK-EUC-H","size":15.61},{"color":1865405,"font":"KaiTi-GBK-EUC-H","size":15.58}]},"dataset_ref":"corpus:front80:v2-candidate","kind":"ZHIPI","locator":{"extraction_ref":"asset:sha256:1c9dee98f867ea07dade7b69b2b8d3987c5046ddb51e1e377c5e306fd26ba900","spans":[{"end":122,"start":62,"unit_ref":"pdf:page:463"}],"transforms":[]},"record_type":"SEGMENT","section_ref":"chapter:33","segment_id":"hlm80:chapter:33:p00003","text":"戚富贵公子，侯王应袭，容易在红粉场中作罪。风流情性，\n诗赋文词，偏只为莺花路间留滞。笑嘻嘻，哭啼啼，总是一般\n情事。 \n","text_sha256":"f85d1dd76f67a19b39189204e7c6c076c42d4bea83130363e40e45c79b406fd5"},{"asset_ref":"asset:primary:hlm:zhihui:v3.1416:pdf","chapter":33,"classification":{"human_review":"PENDING","method":"DECLARED_PDF_TYPOGRAPHY_V2","reasons":["DECLARED_MAIN_FONT_SIZE_COLOR"],"styles":[{"color":2301728,"font":"SimSun-GBK-EUC-H","size":15.58}]},"dataset_ref":"corpus:front80:v2-candidate","kind":"MAIN_TEXT","locator":{"extraction_ref":"asset:sha256:1c9dee98f867ea07dade7b69b2b8d3987c5046ddb51e1e377c5e306fd26ba900","spans":[{"end":512,"start":122,"unit_ref":"pdf:page:463"}],"transforms":[]},"record_type":"SEGMENT","section_ref":"chapter:33","segment_id":"hlm80:chapter:33:p00004","text":" \n  却说王夫人唤他母亲上来，拿几件簪环当面赏与，又吩咐\n请几众僧人念经超度。他母亲磕头谢了出去。 \n  原来宝玉会过雨村回来听见了，便知金钏儿含羞赌气自尽，\n心中早又五内摧伤，进来被王夫人数落教训，也无可回说。见\n宝钗进来，方得便出来，茫然不知何往，背着手，低头一面感\n叹，一面慢慢的走着，信步来至厅上。刚转过屏门，不想对面\n来了一人正往里走，可巧儿撞了个满怀。只听那人喝了一声“站\n住！”宝玉唬了一跳，抬头一看，不是别人，却是他父亲，不\n觉的倒抽了一口气，只得垂手一旁站了。贾政道：“好端端的，\n你垂头丧气嗐些什么？方才雨村来了要见你，叫你那半天你才\n出来；既出来了，全无一点慷慨挥洒谈吐，仍是葳葳蕤蕤。我\n看你脸上一团思欲愁闷气色，这会子又咳声叹气。你那些还不\n足，还不自在？无故这样，却是为何？”宝玉素日虽是口角伶\n俐，只是此时一心总为金钏儿感伤，恨不得此时也身亡命殒，","text_sha256":"b878dc877796f5f503b08fc767293bfb2a2b2b3189bc10498141a437a6c379ed"},{"asset_ref":"asset:primary:hlm:zhihui:v3.1416:pdf","chapter":33,"classification":{"human_review":"PENDING","method":"DECLARED_PDF_TYPOGRAPHY_V2","reasons":["DECLARED_ANNOTATION_COLOR","WITNESS_LABEL_GLYPH"],"styles":[{"color":1865405,"font":"00