:"pdf:page:472"}],"transforms":[]},"record_type":"SEGMENT","section_ref":"chapter:34","segment_id":"hlm80:chapter:34:p00004","text":" \n  话说袭人见贾母王夫人等去后，便走来宝玉身边坐下，含\n泪问他：“怎么就打到这步田地？”宝玉叹气说道：“不过为\n那些事，问他做什么！只是下半截疼的很，你瞧瞧打坏了那里。”\n袭人听说，便轻轻的伸手进去，将中衣褪下。宝玉略动一动，\n便咬着牙叫“嗳哟”，袭人连忙停住手，如此三四次才褪了下\n来。袭人看时，只见腿上半段青紫，都有四指宽的僵痕高了起\n来。袭人咬着牙说道：“我的娘，怎么下般的这么狠手！\n","text_sha256":"aa1c293f04ffdbedd65f9408fac3620a31391bded01c59f0860d026bbeb56ea5"},{"asset_ref":"asset:primary:hlm:zhihui:v3.1416:pdf","chapter":34,"classification":{"human_review":"PENDING","method":"DECLARED_PDF_TYPOGRAPHY_V2","reasons":["HEADER_FOOTNOTE_TITLE_OR_COLLATION_MARKER"],"styles":[{"color":2301728,"font":"SimSun-GBK-EUC-H","size":8.1}]},"dataset_ref":"corpus:front80:v2-candidate","kind":"EDITORIAL","locator":{"extraction_ref":"asset:sha256:1c9dee98f867ea07dade7b69b2b8d3987c5046ddb51e1e377c5e306fd26ba900","spans":[{"end":322,"start":321,"unit_ref":"pdf:page:472"}],"transforms":[]},"record_type":"SEGMENT","section_ref":"chapter:34","segment_id":"hlm80:chapter:34:p00005","text":"①","text_sha256":"9e96ca1ce18ffb97f67c1230d8282320058da75aa86fc44fb435d25c512a5423"}],"page_navigation":[{"end":321,"exact_span_text":" \n  话说袭人见贾母王夫人等去后，便走来宝玉身边坐下，含\n泪问他：“怎么就打到这步田地？”宝玉叹气说道：“不过为\n那些事，问他做什么！只是下半截疼的很，你瞧瞧打坏了那里。”\n袭人听说，便轻轻的伸手进去，将中衣褪下。宝玉略动一动，\n便咬着牙叫“嗳哟”，袭人连忙停住手，如此三四次才褪了下\n来。袭人看时，只见腿上半段青紫，都有四指宽的僵痕高了起\n来。袭人咬着牙说道：“我的娘，怎么下般的这么狠手！\n","extraction_text_sha256":"39e6c6baa565459770cc9387ce433bd9e92f52bad984cf95f8fff5a81db22519","full_pdf":{"asset_ref":"asset:primary:hlm:zhihui:v3.1416:pdf","path":"sources/primary/hongloumeng/zhihui/v3.1416/original.pdf","sha256":"37441da3cb438d1b3eab2b511aa6f1695f309192fa63bea842413ff91655c1d7"},"pdf_page_index_zero_based":471,"physical_page_one_based":472,"start":123,"unit_ref":"pdf:page:472","viewer_fragment":"#page=472"}],"sample":{"reason":"MAIN_TEXT coverage of chapter 34","segment_id":"hlm80:chapter:34:p00004","text_sha256":"aa1c293f04ffdbedd65f9408fac3620a31391bded01c59f0860d026bbeb56ea5"},"segment":{"ass